# Optional. Defaults to the public Base Sepolia endpoint.
# The URL must answer eth_chainId with 84532. Any other chain, including
# Ethereum mainnet (1) and Base mainnet (8453), is refused.
# Cloudflare Pages: this is the only app env var. Set it at build time only
# when replacing the public endpoint. Vite inlines it.
# Leave VITE_CLAIM_RELAYER_URL unset. Do not put PRIVATE_KEY,
# RELAYER_PRIVATE_KEY, SPENCER_RUN_AUTH, LIVE_SUBMIT, or ADMIN_SECRET here.
# VITE_BASE_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=https://sepolia.base.org
